WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.702 --> 00:00:06.645
Cas Builder makes your welcome bot for you.

2
00:00:06.775 --> 00:00:09.845
No technical setup, just a few taps.

3
00:00:10.145 --> 00:00:12.922
Tap New flow, then pick "💬 Cas Builder".

4
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.813
What should happen when someone joins?

5
00:00:16.943 --> 00:00:19.113
Let's tap "Offer VIP 💎".

6
00:00:19.796 --> 00:00:22.040
Next, your channel's topic.

7
00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.291
Tap one, or just type it.

8
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:29.387
Then paste your VIP link, the one people use to join.

9
00:00:29.687 --> 00:00:31.936
Now tap "✨ Just build it for me".

10
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.989
Your whole bot appears on the phone.

11
00:00:35.119 --> 00:00:40.734
A welcome with a Tap Start button, a nudge, and your VIP link once they tap Start.

12
00:00:41.034 --> 00:00:43.230
Cas picks safe settings for you.

13
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:44.639
Like it?

14
00:00:44.769 --> 00:00:46.127
Tap "Yes, perfect 👍".

15
00:00:46.427 --> 00:00:49.508
"See it play ▶" shows it the way a new member sees it.

16
00:00:49.638 --> 00:00:52.330
Tap the glowing Start button to carry on.

17
00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:57.927
Then tap "Send me a test on Telegram".

18
00:00:58.057 --> 00:00:59.837
Nothing is counted.

19
00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:04.655
Happy?

20
00:01:04.785 --> 00:01:06.464
Tap "🚀 Switch it on".

21
00:01:10.372 --> 00:01:11.747
It's live!

22
00:01:11.877 --> 00:01:15.955
To change anything later, just type it, and Cas does the rest.
